OL,3,GNEWSAFamily to take murder victims'
OL,4,Aashes to Argentina
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stepmother of a teenager who
OL,7,Fmurdered three of his family members
OL,8,Fhas said she wants to travel to
OL,9,FArgentina to scatter the victims'
OL,10,Fashes.
OL,12,FNicholas Prosper killed his mother
OL,13,FJuliana Falcon, 48, his brother Kyle,
OL,14,F16, and 13-year-old sister Giselle, at
OL,15,Ftheir home in Luton.
OL,17,FReka Prosper said she and husband
OL,18,FRaymond Prosper wanted to repatriate
OL,19,FFalcon's ashes in her home country,
OL,20,Fwhere Falcon lived until her 20s.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
